msgctxt "#31279"
msgid "Show the personal flags. The personal flags display whether you have watched the item, your rating (if available) and your play count."
msgstr "Show the personal flags. The personal flags display whether you have watched the item, your rating (if available) and your play count."

msgctxt "#31280"
msgid "Show the media flags. The media flags inform you about the length of the selected item, and the year that it was released."
msgstr "Show the media flags. The media flags inform you about the length of the selected item, and the year that it was released."

msgctxt "#31281"
msgid "Show rating flags. The rating flags show the rating (of others) of the selected item, and the MPAA-rating for movies (if it is available)."
msgstr "Show rating flags. The rating flags show the rating (of others) of the selected item, and the MPAA-rating for movies (if it is available)."

msgctxt "#31282"
