msgctxt "#31423"
msgid "On some devices the music can sound choppy and stuttering after the music visualisation is closed. This option works around this issue by not closing the music visualisation, but hiding it behind the background. You may still experience the stuttering sound if the screensaver starts (but this can be avoided by replacing the screensaver with music visualisation during music playback)."
msgstr "On some devices the music can sound choppy and stuttering after the music visualization is closed. This option works around this issue by not closing the music visualization, but hiding it behind the background. You may still experience the stuttering sound if the screensaver starts (but this can be avoided by replacing the screensaver with music visualization during music playback)."

